== Splash Wave Pool schedule_changes "Drop-in schedule - swim and aquafitness"
- IGNORED date-context "Wednesday, July 1"
    at: group "Drop-in schedule - swim and aquafitness"
- NOTICE "The facility is closed and all programs cancelled."
    date text: "Wednesday, July 1"
    dates: 2026-07-01 Wed
    effects: cancelled, closure
    match: SCOPE_PHRASE
    at: group "Drop-in schedule - swim and aquafitness"

== Splash Wave Pool special_hours
- NOTICE "Wednesday, July 1, closed"
